# {{ .Name }}

This data source is a generic way to query for a list of Kubernetes resources and filter them using a label or field selector.

The optional `bootstrap_connection` block supplies credentials for a cluster created earlier in the same apply, which the provider block cannot be configured against. For managing resources across several clusters generally, use an aliased provider instead. See [Bootstrapping a cluster created in the same apply](../resources/manifest.md#bootstrapping-a-cluster-created-in-the-same-apply) for details.

